  "name": "DevX Connector: Generic template (Preview)",
  "description": "## What it does\n\nDemonstrates **Template** mode with **Source: Generic** using **Manual Trigger → DevX Message Connector**. The sample includes a title, body, severity, URL, URL label, and source.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Add a **DevX Message Connector** credential containing the full Teams channel link and configure `DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL` and `DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_KEY`.\n2. Run the workflow manually and inspect the transformed template in the Preview response.\n3. Change **Mode** to **Send** only after reviewing the result.\n\n## Notes\n\nPreview calls `<DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL>/api/v1/messages/preview` without posting to Teams; it is not an offline transformation mode. No credentials or pinned execution data are included.",
